WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Open the ChinaTech toolbox in your browser, go to Office and choose Install only.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.833
The website provides a command reference.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:12.667
Clicking a website button does not install software.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.167
Save your Word, Excel and other unfinished documents.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:20.792
Installation may close Office applications.

00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:25.333
Check the version and selected components described on the page.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:28.500
PowerShell is selected by default.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.083
If you will use CMD, select CMD before copying.

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:38.417
The formats differ, so use the one matching the administrator terminal you open.

00:00:38.417 --> 00:00:41.042
Click Copy full command.

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:46.708
If your browser blocks copying, download the command text and copy it from the file.

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:52.000
Use the full website content rather than typing the long command from this video.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.667
In Windows, open PowerShell as administrator, check the terminal name and paste the entire command.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:03.292
This is an illustration: the video does not run the installation.

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:07.708
Decide whether to press Enter only after saving your documents.

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:11.458
Check the result in the installer's actual output.

00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:17.083
Stop on a 403 response, network error or failed verification.

00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:19.792
Do not bypass the checks.

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:24.000
Installation and a valid license are separate matters.
